@title Check > EMC check: the Magnetic field estimate section (settings, currents with their sources, sensitive devices and wires)
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The window lists each current the estimate uses (the drive's 25 A rating, phases from the U, V and W pins), the field at the PLC and the voltage the analog wire picks up. Findings join the Issues list once the check is on.
open qa/fixtures/emc-field.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text EMC check
key enter
wait 10
expect "Magnetic field estimate"
shot field-collapsed
check_layout
click_text "Magnetic field estimate"
wait 10
expect "rated current of -T1"
expect "never a measurement"
shot field-section
check_layout
scroll 360 400 -250
wait 5
expect "Sensitive devices"
expect "Sensitive wires"
shot field-sensitive
check_layout
click_text "Run the EMC rules with the design checks"
wait 10
expect "EMC-19"
shot field-findings
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text Problems
key enter
wait 10
expect "EMC-19"
shot issues-field
check_layout
